  "concept": {
    "description": "Entirely mechanical biped Metal Gear: ivory armored hull over black structural spars, broad low sensor head with dark optical slit, diagonal chest equipment rail, asymmetrical anatomical-right dark knee armor translated to the machine right knee, articulated two manipulators and two powered legs. No flesh, hair, ponytail, human face, eyes, fabric or breast-shaped armor. Patriot-inspired ballistic module and retractable mechanical blade preserve captured move meanings."
