    "Original whole-machine tribute to The Boss; no official Metal Gear model, human hair/face/flesh or canonical machine height claimed.",
    "Source gun module is still under fine-geometry review against original Patriot inventory reference; no 1:1 weapon certification or runtime admission.",
    "Core The Boss has no Patriot projectile; Versus specialDown is ballistic. Exact Core-to-role routing must remain separate.",
    "Native metalgear family needs a scoped reviewed compiler/renderer guard; do not expand native acceptance globally.",
    "Two gait drawings per facing require independent near/far thigh and density review.",
    "All native body-axis, calibration, anatomy, equipment placement and ports require independent Root physical review. Full action selection and projectile timing must be tested in actual Versus and Core; VM roster audit is not browser combat QA.",
    "bodyAxesPath contains framing proposals only, including manual waist/pelvis hints on horizontal poses, never automatic anatomy approval.",
    "Manual32pelvis proposals, source contact/sole ordinates and actual opaque barrel points remain Root pending; any incorrect value must be replaced before approval/compile."
